Package: camera-coordinator-autolight
Version: 0.1.0
Section: video
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Shuhao Wu <shuhao@shuhaowu.com>
Depends: libc6, init-system-helpers, camera-coordinator
Homepage: https://github.com/shuhaowu/cameracoordinator
Description: A service that listens for D-Bus events emitted by camera-coordinator and turns on/off the screen backlight when webcams turn on/off.

